  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 088</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>88 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"88번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:81%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q088\" data-question=\"Q088\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q088</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Lambda functions connect to a private RDS database. Which TWO services address connection spikes and secure storage of credentials?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Route 53 weighted record</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결을 풀링하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">이전 문제 <b>Q087</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q089/\">다음 문제 <b>Q089</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
